  hot_path no
  standing_path yes
  effect_path YES
  production_required YES
  current_owner Python
  intended_owner unresolved
  disposition audit candidate; the source-mutation carrier is foundational and should not be owned by convenience
  note this session added node-syntax and php-lint profiles to it, which deepened rather than reduced that ownership

