body_role bdr:semantic-derivation
  body components/BonfyreControlPlane/semantic_derivation.py.archive
  runtime_family Python
  role REFERENCE_IMPLEMENTATION
  hot_path no
  effect_path no
  production_required no
  disposition PRESERVE as specification and equivalence oracle
  rationale it is clear, inspectable, witnessed by 15 passing tests, and slow in a way that does not matter for an oracle
  lowering_target the canonical incremental_semantic_derivation substrate with its content-addressed store and dependency-cone invalidation
  equivalence_test generate random dependency graphs and prove reference_slice(delta) equals native_slice(delta) before making the native body authoritative
  note this is the ideal first lowering campaign: hot semantics, clear contract, existing tests, existing lower substrate

